n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-25T10:19:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37"],"images":[{"caption":null,"content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69de23bb961ff0ba6bff8e0a/s216_DfE_Sanctuary_Building_London_office.jpeg","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69de23bb3e81003ae042250c/s300_DfE_Sanctuary_Building_London_office.jpeg","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69de23bb2b60817d99ff8e04/s465_DfE_Sanctuary_Building_London_office.jpeg","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69de23bb961ff0ba6bff8e0b/s630_DfE_Sanctuary_Building_London_office.jpeg","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69de23bb838a3d1fb7b2c32b/s712_DfE_Sanctuary_Building_London_office.jpeg","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69de23bb9af91e9ee4b2c327/s960_DfE_Sanctuary_Building_London_office.jpeg"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"press_release","first_published_at":"2026-02-25T10:19:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/sir-kevan-collins-appointed-as-delivery-adviser-to-the-secretary-of-state-for-education","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/sir-kevan-collins-appointed-as-delivery-adviser-to-the-secretary-of-state-for-education","base_path":"/government/news/sir-kevan-collins-appointed-as-delivery-adviser-to-the-secretary-of-state-for-education","content_id":"36fdb608-18c2-40c9-92fb-bbf60af21306","document_type":"press_release","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-25T10:19:00Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"Sir Kevan Collins appointed as Delivery Adviser to the Secretary of State for Education","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/sir-kevan-collins-appointed-as-delivery-adviser-to-the-secretary-of-state-for-education","